[+60 FPS scheduler]
// Status: verified site; incomplete and broken when enabled alone.
// Produces the 59.94 Hz engine cadence, but doubles uncompensated battle work.
// Sequential replay status: boot-wide activation reaches the pre-input anchor
// at frame 2589 with wrong fighter positions and action-timeline cursors.
// A battle-ready activation boundary is required before input parity can test.
// Rejected boundary: clean inner state 4 at frame 2437 still owns the opening
// clash; activation there reached frame 2589 at about +/-183 and cursor 12,
// versus clean about +/-255 and cursor 50. Test the post-opening idle boundary.
// Runtime activation must call the live threshold setter: changing this
// one-time initializer after boot left context +0x01 at 2. A direct frame-2491
// live switch restored cursor 50 at frame 2589, but history was 3 vs clean 2
// and X positions were not bit-exact. The activation hook is still unresolved.
