// multiply the selected +0x1AC value by +0x1B4, then by 0.5, store it, and
// preserve the original a0=s1 / a1=0 call setup. No code cave is used.
// Runtime: both fighters changed from forced 0.0 to exactly 0.5 at frame 5446.
// Synthetic branch tests also produced 0.8*1.0*0.5=0.4 and
// 1.0*0.25*0.5=0.125; all +0x1B0/+0x1B4 composition paths are covered.
// Boot-combined replay: both live factors were exactly 0.5 at frame 2400;
// over frames 2400..2412 the fractional cursor gained 0.5 each VBlank and
// the authored integer cursor advanced every other VBlank. The independent
// transform-history index still advanced every VBlank and needs another fix.
// Sequential frame-2491 activation: both full fighter objects matched clean
// before injection. At the first clean logical endpoint, frame 2493, the
// authored cursor matched but whole-update fields +0x4C4, +0x548, +0x8C0,
// and +0xB98 were each one update ahead, and positions were not bit-exact.
// Status: factor compensation is necessary but not sufficient; fighter logic
// and history need a separate 30 Hz phase gate before input frame 2590 can test.
