// The narrower FUN_0034CE00 spawn gate below stopped due spawns but still let
// long-lived controller +0x04 update counts and lifecycle state advance every
// physical VBlank; by frame 2615 a candidate count was 62 updates ahead.
// This complete gate restored emitter accumulator, update count, semantic
// records, and the related shared-RNG position to the clean sequence.
// Raw frame-2611 differences were only heap pointer identity and generator byte
// +0x19B, which FUN_0034A070 leaves uninitialized. Meaningful +0x198..+0x19A
// state and all eight constructor calls matched clean, so no padding patch is
