[-Recurring CCS animation clock]
// Status: runtime-proven recurring mechanism; this global edit remains unsafe.
// A behavior-preserving input-boundary logger found 17 candidate-only even-frame
// FUN_001BB210 calls across six recurring return sites: 003962B8, 006C4F58,
// 00712DA8, 0071DA34, 0071DBFC, and 006B85A8. Six fighter/overlay calls already
// retain clean odd-only cadence and must not be halved. Site 003962B8 also uses
// 153 and 230 increments, which require remainder/carry rather than truncation.
// This edit changes the default automatic clock from 1.0 to 0.5, but it also
// halves one-shot constructor priming and cannot classify custom increments.
// Keep it disabled; implement and test the proven recurring consumers instead.
// Clean word: 24030100.
patch=1,EE,201B7524,extended,24030080 // li v1,0x80

